<title>PHILIPPINES: Asiatrust to pay 50 pct stock dividend.</title>
<headline>Asiatrust to pay 50 pct stock dividend.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Asiatrust Bank said on Friday its board of directors had approved a plan to pay a 50 percent stock dividend to shareholders.</p>
<p>The record date is yet to be announced.</p>
<p>The bank had also sought the approval of the Securities and Exchange Commission to double its capital stock to 2.0 billion pesos from 1.0 billion pesos, a statement from the bank said.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418938 Fax 8176267</p>
</text>
